{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Simple Steps 是一款重視私隱的簡潔計步工具，適合不想註冊帳號、不想被廣告與追蹤打擾，只想專心記錄每日步數的使用者。它利用 Apple HealthKit 與裝置內建計步器讀取步數資料，不作其他用途，也不收集、儲存或分享任何個人資訊。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>簡潔介面掌握每日步數</h2>\n<p>今日檢視以環形進度錶顯示步數，並追蹤卡路里、距離與活躍分鐘。步行模式可設定指定步數或時間目標，也可自由步行。報告頁以簡潔圖表呈現每週與每月紀錄、每日平均值與持續程度；目標功能讓你可設定每日最低與最高步數，見證進度由最低走向進階目標。全程無需帳號、毋須連線，亦不設 GPS、廣告與訂閱。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-393-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-394-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-395-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-396-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-397-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-398-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Simple Steps</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-26T11:18:40.301728+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":350,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}